    (0, None, '\'Max, my friend, what is happening to you right now?\' "Chto s toboy proiskhodit" is "what\'s happening with you", the question Vika asked Kostya about Max, "chto proiskhodit s nashim Maksom". "Drug" is "friend".'),
    (1, None, '\'Kostya, I still cannot believe it.\' "Do sikh por", literally "up to these times", is "still". "Poverit" is "to believe", with po- on the front of "verit". "Ne mogu" is "I can\'t".'),
